{{- if .Module.REST -}}
## internal/app/{{ .Module.Name }}/rest/router.go

Inside `Register`, mount the new routes:

```go
register{{ .Entity.Name }}Routes(group, directives, new{{ .Entity.Name }}Controller(service.GetFactory().Get{{ .Entity.Name }}Service()))
```

If the module has no `rest` package yet, render one with bootstrap in module mode into a scratch
directory and copy `rest/router.go` and `rest/router_test.go` over, then mount `rest.Init` in the
service's router.
{{- end }}
